Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 05:10:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(auth): scope singleton quota recovery to proven row and
 failure [daveey]

HTTP-only singleton tests reproduce both missing-window resurrection and clearing unrelated accounts. Scope evidence to reset/failure, compare row generation before clearing, and log the early lift. Boundary, cache-expiry, explicit-reset resync and all-walled readmission tests pass. Broad consumer run: 272 files, 4838 passed, one performance threshold failure; isolated candidate and parent reruns pass. Mutation validation and final publication remain.
